' diagram-type: sequence
@startuml
title v0005-executor-k8s - executor_k8s_openhands team-scope topology (FIFO claim)

!pragma layout smetana

note over k8s_executor
  Concrete Executor services follow the platform naming convention
  documented in AGENTS.md:
    executor_<runtime>_<tool>
  Current concrete Executor: executor_docker_openhands
  (runtime = docker, tool = openhands; "openhands" is the service
  identifier; the external product spelling "OpenHands" stays
  unchanged).
  This K8s Executor will follow the same pattern:
    executor_k8s_openhands
  with runtime = k8s and tool = openhands. The wire value and
  topology below are pinned to that concrete OpenHands binding.
end note

participant "Authenticated\nExecutor identity" as executor_identity
participant "K8s Executor\nexecutor_k8s_openhands" as k8s_executor
participant "State Registry" as state_registry
participant "Kubernetes API" as kubernetes_api
participant "Agent Pod" as agent_pod

== Registration (team-bound) ==
k8s_executor -> executor_identity : present service credential\n(bound team_id = T-A)
activate k8s_executor
k8s_executor -> state_registry : POST /v1/executors\n{scope = team, executor_type = executor_k8s_openhands,\nexactly one team_id = T-A, exactly one authorized_tag,\nobserved max_capacity, observed running_count, runtime metadata}
activate state_registry
state_registry -> state_registry : verify team_id matches identity-bound team\nreject zero/extra team_id\nreject team_id change
state_registry --> k8s_executor : 201 Executor record\n(server-generated executor_id, scope = team, team_id = T-A,\nauthorized_tag, observed capacity)
deactivate state_registry
k8s_executor -> k8s_executor : atomically persist executor_id in recovery cache

== Local capacity decision (Executor side only) ==
k8s_executor -> k8s_executor : locally observe running_count vs max_capacity\ndecide locally whether to discover and claim

== Discovery (same-team exact tag, pending FIFO) ==
k8s_executor -> state_registry : GET /v1/executors/{executor_id}/tasks\n?tag={exact_registered_tag}
activate state_registry
state_registry -> state_registry : SELECT pending tasks\nWHERE required_tag = registered_tag\n  AND team_id = T-A\nORDER BY ingested_at ASC, task_id ASC\n(eligibility predicate first;\nno capacity check)
alt matching same-team pending task exists
  state_registry --> k8s_executor : 200 pending task summaries
else no same-team pending task matches
  state_registry --> k8s_executor : 204 No Content\n(or 200 with empty task list,\nno count, cursor, total, or pagination metadata)
end
deactivate state_registry

== Foreign-team discovery (collection level, team-filter-before-result-shaping) ==
k8s_executor -> state_registry : GET /v1/executors/{executor_id}/tasks\n?tag={exact_registered_tag}
activate state_registry
state_registry -> state_registry : filter by team_id = T-A\nBEFORE result shaping\n(eligibility predicate applied first)
state_registry --> k8s_executor : 204 No Content\n(or 200 with empty task list,\nno count, cursor, total, or pagination metadata)
deactivate state_registry
k8s_executor -> k8s_executor : 204/empty-list is indistinguishable\nfrom "no tasks match this tag anywhere"; \nno Pod, no event

== FIFO claim (same-team exact tag, atomic) ==
k8s_executor -> state_registry : POST /v1/executors/{executor_id}/claim\n{task_id, command_id}
activate state_registry
state_registry -> state_registry : verify task is pending\nverify required_tag = registered_tag\nverify team_id = T-A\nverify task is oldest eligible pending\nresolve resolved_image (4-level precedence)\nSET owner_command_id = command_id\nSET executor_id = claiming_executor\nSET resolved_image, image_source\nSET claimed_at = now()\nAPPEND FIRST created event\n  (executor_id = claiming_executor,\n   payload = task <task_id> loaded by <executor_id>)\nproject task to created
state_registry --> k8s_executor : 200 claimed\n+ resolved_image + image_source\n+ claimed_at + environment_id\n+ compact scope token\n  (allow-listed HMAC HS256/HS384/HS512;\n   header: alg, kid, typ = scope-token+json;\n   payload: team_id, project_id\n    [required non-null when env has\n    project scope, nullable only when\n    no project scope], task_id,\n    environment_id, executor_id,\n    audience = state-registry.environment.open,\n    key_id, issued_at, expiry)
deactivate state_registry

== Running event before Pod creation ==
k8s_executor -> state_registry : POST /v1/tasks/{task_id}/events\n{task_id, executor_id, team_id = T-A,\nevent_id, event_type = running,\noccurred_at, payload}
activate state_registry
state_registry --> k8s_executor : 202 accepted
deactivate state_registry

== Pod creation and runtime ==
k8s_executor -> kubernetes_api : create task Pod from resolved_image
activate kubernetes_api
kubernetes_api -> agent_pod : schedule and start agent runtime
activate agent_pod
kubernetes_api --> k8s_executor : Pod scheduled
deactivate kubernetes_api
k8s_executor -> kubernetes_api : watch Pod phase and logs
note right of agent_pod : Pod carries labels:\nflowai.executor_id\nflowai.team_id = T-A\nflowai.task_id\nflowai.command_id\nflowai.executor_scope = team\nflowai.resolved_image_source\nflowai.runtime = k8s

== Terminal events ==
k8s_executor -> state_registry : POST /v1/tasks/{task_id}/events\n{task_id, executor_id, team_id = T-A,\nevent_id, event_type = finished | failed,\noccurred_at, payload}
activate state_registry
state_registry --> k8s_executor : 202 accepted
deactivate state_registry
k8s_executor -> kubernetes_api : delete or clean up terminal Pod
deactivate agent_pod

== Claim-conflict taxonomy ==
note over state_registry
  Same (task_id, command_id) retry by the\noriginal Executor returns the original\n200 claimed body with no new event.
  Different command_id on already-claimed\ntask returns 409 task_already_claimed.
  Eligible non-oldest pending task returns\n409 older_task_must_be_claimed_first.
  Unknown or foreign task_id returns\nnon-revealing 404 with no mutation,\nno event, no Pod.
end note

== Assigned task environment open (inherited v0002 token contract) ==
k8s_executor -> state_registry : GET /v1/environments/{environment_id}/open\n?task_id={task_id}\nX-FlowAI-Scope-Token: <header>.<payload>.<signature>
activate state_registry
state_registry -> state_registry : verify kid == key_id BEFORE any MAC\nreject alg outside allow-listed HS256/HS384/HS512\nconstant-time MAC compare under declared algorithm\nverify key_id in documented active window\n(retired key_id rejected)\nverify expiry > issued_at\nverify expiry - issued_at <= 5 minutes\nverify issued_at <= server_now + 30 seconds\nverify audience = state-registry.environment.open\nverify canonical claim shape\n(project_id present, non-null when project-scoped)\nverify every claim against canonical records\nverify authenticated Executor mTLS identity\nmatches assigned same-team Executor\nverify task is in non-terminal state\nverify project/task applicability
alt every check passes (BEFORE any decrypt operation or plaintext)
  state_registry --> k8s_executor : 200 env-style values (in-memory only)\n+ plaintext-free team-scoped audit entry\n(executor_id, environment_id, task_id,\naudience, key_id, access time)
else any invalid / tampered / missing-claim /\n  kid != key_id / alg-outside-set / retired-key /\n  expiry <= issued_at / TTL > 5 min /\n  premature-beyond-30s / audience-mismatch /\n  null project_id for project-scoped env /\n  missing project_id / foreign-team /\n  unassigned / terminal-state /\n  applicability-violating
  state_registry --> k8s_executor : 404 environment_unknown_or_unavailable\n(no values, zero provider decrypt operations,\nno audit, no plaintext,\nidentical shape for every invalid variant)
end
deactivate state_registry

== Pending control reads (assigned task in bound team) ==
k8s_executor -> state_registry : GET /v1/tasks/{task_id}/controls
activate state_registry
alt task assigned to executor AND team_id = T-A
  state_registry --> k8s_executor : 200 pending control
  k8s_executor -> agent_pod : apply control
else task in different team or different executor
  state_registry --> k8s_executor : 404 not_found
end
deactivate state_registry

== Informational observation reports ==
k8s_executor -> state_registry : POST /v1/executors/{executor_id}/events\n{executor_id, team_id = T-A,\nevent_id,\nobserved max_capacity, observed running_count,\noccurred_at, payload}
activate state_registry
state_registry -> state_registry : append executor_events\n+ mirror latest max_capacity and running_count\nonto executors row in same transaction\n(informational only, never gates discovery or claim)
state_registry --> k8s_executor : 202 accepted
deactivate state_registry
deactivate k8s_executor

@enduml
